The nearest town is Prince Albert -[ just] 4 km from the northern end of the pass. There is plenty see[,] from flora to fauna, and some mind b[ogg]ling geology. The fynbos[ is] at its best in winter and spring with proteas, ericas, rest[ios] and pin-[c]ushions in profusion.
