> [Over] the past five years, I’ve analyzed data on a wide range of products from lip balm to dog food, from potato chips to ke[f]ir.[ And] while categories of interest have changed, my general best practices for analyzing the data remain constant. Data can be complicated and challenging, but, if you know how to harness it, transform it, and understand its meaning, it can be a game-changer with immense value to your business.
